{'name': 'Century Frontier Asset Management', 'city': 'Hong Kong', 'country': 'Hong Kong SAR', 'location': {'lat': 22.2864399, 'lon': 114.1536781}, 'description': 'Founded in 2015, Century Frontier Asset Management is a private fund manager specialised in quantitative investment in China market. The firm is 
registered with Asset Management Association of China (AMAC) in 2018 and now manages over US$9 billion of total assets.

Frontier Asset Management (Hong Kong) Limited, established on 16 June 2023,  is an affiliate of Century Frontier Asset Management. The firm is licensed and regulated by the Securities and Futures Commission of Hong Kong (“SFC”) in March 2024 to conduct Type 9 (Asset Management) Regulated Activities.'}

{'name': 'Vor Capital LLP', 'city': 'London', 'country': 'United Kingdom', 'location': {'lat': 51.5179868, 'lon': -0.1375121}, 'description': 'London-based Vor Capital is a long-term, fundamental, value-based investment fund manager. The Fund invests, typically, in a select collection of defensible, niche monopolies, leveraging its expertise in consumer, media and Internet. 

The Fund seeks to capitalize on opportunities on both the long and short side of its portfolio.

Vor is led by Brant Rubin, formerly of Luxor Capital and graduate of Yale (BA) and Columbia Business School (MBA, Value Investing Program).'}

{'name': 'Beach Point Capital Management LP', 'city': 'Santa Monica', 'country': 'United States of America', 'location': {'lat': 34.0293737, 'lon': -118.4707481}, 'description': 'Beach Point Capital Management LP ("Beach Point") is a multi-strategy investment manager specializing in high yield bonds, senior bank loans, private credit, and distressed debt investing.  The firm offers multiple vehicles with varying return objectives, investment horizons, and liquidity terms within our Opportunistic Credit, Performing Credit, Private Credit and Structured Credit & Asset-Based Finance strategies. Beach Point manages nearly $20.8 billion in assets for private and public pension funds, endowments, foundations, family offices, hedge fund of funds, and high net worth individuals.

Since inception, Beach Point has invested up and down the capital structure and across a wide range of geographies and sectors. Our team has compiled an attractive track record through a sound investment philosophy and a value-oriented, risk-controlled process. Throughout Beach Point’s history, growth has been deliberately measured in favor of developing long-term, stable relationships with the goal of delivering quality client service and consistent investment performance. The quality and consistency of performance is the result of hiring investment professionals with training in credit research, legal analysis, and capital structure analysis.

Note: Please see important disclosures at the end of this document for more information regarding the calculation of assets under management.'}

{'name': 'Pacific Way', 'city': 'New York', 'country': 'United States of America', 'location': {'lat': 40.7602595, 'lon': -73.97221449999999}, 'description': 'Pacific Way Capital Management is a diversified multi-strategy hedge fund manager founded in 2025 by Sam Diedrich, with strategic backing from Partners Capital and Leucadia Asset Management. Pacific Way’s flagship strategy, the Eagle Harbor Multi-Strategy Fund, was launched by Sam within Partners Capital in 2020. 

The Pacific Way Eagle Harbor Multi-Strategy Fund is designed as an all-weather portfolio, targeting strong risk-adjusted returns with low volatility, minimal correlation to major indices, an equity beta near zero, and capital preservation during periods of market stress.  

Pacific Way seeks to provide a strategic investment edge by attracting and serving the needs of established PMs seeking an entrepreneurial path, while unlocking enhanced value and partnership opportunities for LPs in a highly cost-effective structure.'}

{'name': 'Meridian & Saturn Capital Pte. Ltd. (MS Capital)', 'city': 'Singapore', 'country': 'Singapore', 'location': {'lat': 1.2988407, 'lon': 103.7878988}, 'description': 'Meridian & Saturn Capital Pte. Ltd. ( “MS Capital” ) was founded in Singapore by our CIO Jiaqi Zhu (Jude) and CEO Kate Zhang in 2022, as an important footstep for international expansion of Meridian China. It is registered under Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) for Fund Management business since November 2023.

Founded in October 2013 in China, Meridian Global Inc. established itself as market-leading China A-share high frequency trading firm and one of the earliest China manager to adopt deep learning into the quantitative investment process since 2016. 

Globally the group manages around $800mil USD across different quantitative strategies such as Equities Market Neutral (China-A, Pan-Europe, Japan), Enhanced Indexing/Long-only (China-A), Systematic macro (Global) and Convertible Bond (China). We have 80+ talented employees across research, portfolio management, infrastructure, operations and other business functions.'}

{'name': 'Maverick Capital, Ltd.', 'city': 'Dallas', 'country': 'United States of America', 'location': {'lat': 32.79027790000001, 'lon': -96.7995971}, 'description': 'Since our founding in 1993, Maverick has been dedicated to the preservation and growth of our investors’ capital.  Maverick’s 99 partners and employees are based in Dallas, Miami, New York, San Francisco, Santa Clara and West Palm Beach.  The firm is guided by Maverick’s Founder and Managing Partner, Lee S. Ainslie III.  Maverick has been registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission since 1994.  
 
Maverick manages long/short equity hedge funds, long only and neutral funds, and private venture, growth and silicon funds.  Of the total AUM of $13 billion, over two-thirds is attributable to profits generated by Maverick for its investors.  Collectively, partners, employees and related entities represent roughly 30% of the net assets under management, demonstrating strong alignment of interests between Maverick and its investors.

Our investment and operating decisions are guided by the principle of placing investors’ interests ahead of all other considerations.  We strive to maintain the highest standards of integrity and ethical conduct.  Those standards are embodied in our Code of Conduct to which all our partners and employees are personally committed.  Maverick investors enjoy transparency, confidentiality and consistent treatment.  Our overarching objective is to develop and maintain a reputation for both ethical conduct and a record of performance in which every Maverick partner and employee can take great pride.'}

