{'name': 'Tenaron Capital Management LP', 'city': 'New York', 'country': 'United States of America', 'location': {'lat': 40.7507673, 'lon': -73.9793811}, 'description': 'Tenaron Capital Management LP (“Tenaron” or the “Firm”) is a global asset manager headquartered in New York that began trading in 2016 and manages two separate strategies – a macro liquid rates trading strategy (the “Macro Investment Strategy”) and a relative value liquid rates trading strategy (the “RV Investment Strategy”).

The Firm is registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (“SEC”) as an investment adviser and with the Commodities Futures Trading Commission (“CFTC”) as a Commodity Pool Operator (“CPO”) and Swap firm. Its sub-investment manager, Tenaron Capital Management UK LLP (the “Sub-IM”), is authorized by the Financial Conduct Authority (“FCA”) as a MiFID prudential firm.

Peter Lurie serves as Chief Executive Officer & General Counsel of the Firm, and Das Ganeshan serves as Chief Risk Officer & Chief Operating Officer.'}

