{'name': 'Navi Capital', 'city': 'Rio de Janeiro', 'country': 'Brazil', 'location': {'lat': -22.9850208, 'lon': -43.2263211}, 'description': 'Navi Group is a Brazilian investment group with over 15 years of proven track record and a history of consistent top-quartile performance within the Brazilian equity fund industry.

We currently manage approximately USD 1.2 billion across three strategies — Long Only, Long Biased, and Long & Short — and maintain a long-term institutional investor base composed of pension funds, sovereign wealth funds, major banks, and family offices.

For us, investing is about developing a deep understanding of businesses and standing alongside entrepreneurs to support the growth of projects and companies. It also means preserving our partners’ and clients’ capital while helping them achieve their long-term objectives.'}

