{'name': 'Alphadyne Asset Management LP', 'city': 'New York', 'country': 'United States of America', 'location': {'lat': 40.7028885, 'lon': -74.0138771}, 'description': 'Alphadyne Asset Management is an alternative investment management firm led by founding member and Chief Investment Officer Philippe Khuong-Huu. Investors include pension funds, insurance companies, asset managers, investment consultants and sovereign wealth funds. Alphadyne, launched in 2005, has offices in New York, London, Tokyo, Hong Kong, Singapore, Copenhagen and Bangalore. 

The Funds’ investment objective is to provide attractive risk-adjusted returns through a diversified portfolio of investments primarily in the global interest rate, foreign exchange and volatility markets. The Funds seek to provide returns that are uncorrelated to broad market indices.

Alphadyne Business Solutions (India) Private Limited (“Alphadyne India”) is an Indian limited company wholly owned by Alphadyne Asset Management LP.\xa0Alphadyne India’s initial focus will be on developing technology infrastructure and other support functions – no investment or trading activity is being conducted from this location, consequently, Alphadyne India is not registered with the SEC or any other investment-related foreign regulatory body.'}

