{'name': 'ShadowFall Capital & Research LLP', 'city': 'London', 'country': 'United Kingdom', 'location': {'lat': 51.518643, 'lon': -0.0982078}, 'description': 'ShadowFall Capital & Research is a London based European short focused investment manager founded by Matthew Earl in 2017. We manage >$200m on behalf of our partners across pan-European equity market neutral and short only strategies. 

ShadowFall Fund is a European equity market neutral strategy that aims to deliver absolute returns throughout the cycle with a low correlation to markets. We have a differentiated focus on aiming to generate short alpha from uncrowded European mid-cap equities. We identify short positions through a combination of deep dive fundamental analysis and investigative research. The strategy typically consists of ~20 single stock equity short positions and a diversified custom long hedge. The construction aims to concentrate risk in our idiosyncratic short theses and limit exposure to market and factor risk.

ShadowFall is Authorised and Regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority and registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission as a Registered Investment Adviser.'}

disclaimer:
This marketing communication is issued to you by Capital Fund Management S.A. (“CFM SA”) or one of its subsidiaries: Capital Fund Management LLP (“CFM LLP”), Capital Fund Management International, Inc. (“CFMI”), CFM Canada Ltd. (“CFM Canada”) and CFM North America Inc. (“CFM NA”; collectively, “CFM”). CFM investor materials are issued by CFM LLP in the UK and Australia, CFM SA in Europe and Switzerland, CFMI or CFM NA in the USA and CFM Canada in Canada. However, CFM SA may issue certain investor materials directly. Please contact your investor representative if you have any questions as to the CFM entity that has issued this document.
