LFIS was established in 2013, and is a partner of Walter GAM since 2021.

Employing 35 professionals with extensive Asset Management, capital markets and derivatives experience, LFIS manages assets for institutional clients and has expertise in traditional factors, implied parameters, synthetic credit, mid-frequency statistical arbitrage and hedging strategies.'}

