{'name': 'Bayforest Technologies', 'city': 'London', 'country': 'United Kingdom', 'location': {'lat': 51.4988194, 'lon': -0.1333026}, 'description': 'Prior to founding Bayforest in 2017 Dr. Theodoros Tsagaris was central to the development of Tudor’s London quantitative proprietary trading desk over 6.5 years and one of the few PMs to run partner money as well as client money.

Bayforest uses machine learning and big data techniques where appropriate to the investment process.  This is an advancement on Theo’s academic work at Imperial (PhD and published papers).  This academic sophistication is combined with his practical experience of building and trading investment strategies across multiple asset classes and investment products since 2004 at Bluecrest, GSA and Tudor.

Bayforest has a multi-disciplinary team with an average of circa 20 years domain expertise per employee combining institutional software product development with data science and trading experience.  It is this combination of disciplines we feel is central to the firm’s success.'}

{'name': 'Tresidor Investment Management LLP', 'city': 'London', 'country': 'United Kingdom', 'location': {'lat': 51.5158165, 'lon': -0.1487333}, 'description': 'Tresidor is a London-based alternative credit manager focused on making research-led investments across the full spectrum of tradeable European credit. Tresidor was founded in 2018 by CIO Michael Phelps, the former Head of European Fundamental Credit for BlackRock, where he managed ~$35bn in European credit investments. Michael has over 20 years experience investing in credit markets, utilising the same disciplined fundamental research process that drives Tresidor’s performance. 

Tresidor manages over $2.5bn firmwide AUM for a diversified international institutional investor base, and offers investors a choice of two fundamental European credit strategies; a diversified long/short credit fund "TECF" (which hard-closed for a second time in July 2023, after reopening in January 2023) and a long-only opportunistic distressed credit fund "TECOF", which remains open.

Tresidor has a 24-strong team, including 14 investment professionals, the majority of whom have previously worked with Michael, creating strong continuity of people as well as of process. We are equally committed to our institutional-grade non-investment team and infrastructure, led by CEO Edgar Senior, who has 20 years of experience across credit and hedge funds.'}

