{'name': 'SummitTX Capital (fka Crestline Investors)', 'city': 'Fort Worth', 'country': 'United States of America', 'location': {'lat': 32.7563305, 'lon': -97.3318609}, 'description': 'Crestline is an employee-controlled asset management firm founded in 1997. The company was originally formed to manage the alternative investments of Edward P. Bass and in 2001 was expanded to outside investors. The firm’s mission is to provide attractive risk-adjusted returns for sophisticated asset owners. We believe our investment expertise and innovative products will pursue value creation in global markets.

Crestline employs 87 investment professionals with broad investment experience across market cycles, geographies, and asset classes. In addition, we believe our team of dedicated professionals provides the highest caliber of operational excellence, relationship management and governance for Crestline’s clients.

Crestline Summit was launched in 2015, with institutional backing and is led by portfolio manager Caroline Cooley who has over 30 years of experience in the alternative investment industry as a portfolio manager, risk manager and trader.'}

